{%- comment -%}
============================================================================
HTML-MARKETING-SHOWCASE
============================================================================
Showcase image with hotspot dots; every dot has its own modal (popover on
desktop, bottom sheet on mobile) with price, variant choice, add to cart /
view product and previous/next through the showcase.
Contract: docs/showcase.md

PARAMS:
- showcase        : showcase metaobject (required)
- id_prefix       : Unique prefix for popover IDs (required)
- default_action  : 'product' | 'cart' | 'both' (default 'both') — used when
                    a hotspot has no own action
- image_loading   : 'lazy' | 'eager' (default 'lazy')
- sizes           : sizes attribute for the image (default '100vw')
- crop_ratio      : Optional frame ratio (e.g. 1 or 0.8). Empty = the image's
                    natural ratio. With a ratio the frame crops like 'cover'.

FRAME + STAGE:
- The frame adapts to its context (natural ratio, or crop_ratio as 'cover')
  and clips. The stage inside always has the image's natural ratio and
  carries the dots, so posx/posy always refer to the whole photo. Dots that
  fall outside a crop are clipped — image choice is the editor's job.

NUMBERING:
- Each unique product gets a number (dot order). The number is always in the
  markup; CSS shows it only inside .showcase--numbered (image + products).

OUTPUT HOOKS (block-marketing-showcase.js, all delegated):
- [data-showcase-hotspot="<product id>"] dot ↔ [data-showcase-card] sync
- [data-showcase-popover] modal, [data-showcase-step] prev/next
- [data-showcase-variants] / [data-showcase-variant] variant choice → the
  html-button-order form's hidden id input

DEPENDENCIES:
- html-product-price, html-button-order, html-theme-icons snippets
============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
	assign showcase_image = showcase.image.value
	assign hotspots = showcase.hotspots.value
	assign default_action = default_action | default: 'both'
	assign image_loading = image_loading | default: 'lazy'
	assign sizes = sizes | default: '100vw'
	assign showcase_title = showcase.title.value | default: showcase.system.handle

	comment
		Count valid hotspots (for "x of y") — variant wins over product.
	endcomment
	assign total = 0
	for hotspot in hotspots
		assign cp = hotspot.variant.value.product | default: hotspot.product.value
		if cp != blank
			assign total = total | plus: 1
		endif
	endfor
-%}

{%- if showcase_image != blank -%}
	<div class="showcase" data-showcase data-showcase-url="{{ showcase.system.url }}" data-showcase-count="{{ total }}">
		<div
			class="showcase__frame"
			style="--showcase-ratio: {{ showcase_image.aspect_ratio }};{% if crop_ratio != blank %} --showcase-crop: {{ crop_ratio }};{% endif %}"
		>
		<div class="showcase__stage">
			{{- showcase_image
				| image_url: width: 2000
				| image_tag:
					class: 'showcase__image',
					loading: image_loading,
					widths: '600,900,1200,1600,2000',
					sizes: sizes,
					alt: showcase_title
			-}}

			{%- liquid
				assign pos = 0
				assign num_map = ','
				assign num_count = 0
			-%}
			{%- for hotspot in hotspots -%}
				{%- liquid
					comment
						Variant wins: product comes from the variant when set,
						so product/variant can never mismatch.
					endcomment
					assign hv = hotspot.variant.value
					assign hp = hotspot.product.value
					if hv != blank and hv.product != blank
						assign hp = hv.product
					endif
					if hp == blank
						continue
					endif
					assign pos = pos | plus: 1

					comment
						Number per unique product (same product twice = same number)
					endcomment
					assign key = ',' | append: hp.id | append: ':'
					if num_map contains key
						assign num = num_map | split: key | last | split: ',' | first
					else
						assign num_count = num_count | plus: 1
						assign num = num_count
						assign num_map = num_map | append: hp.id | append: ':' | append: num_count | append: ','
					endif

					assign hx = hotspot.posx.value | default: 50 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100
					assign hy = hotspot.posy.value | default: 50 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100
					assign action = hotspot.action.value | default: default_action
					assign popover_id = 'showcase-' | append: id_prefix | append: '-' | append: pos

					assign link_url = hp.url
					if hv != blank
						assign link_url = hv.url
					endif

					assign show_link = true
					assign show_cart = true
					if action == 'product'
						assign show_cart = false
					elsif action == 'cart'
						assign show_link = false
					endif

					comment
						Variant choice in the modal: only when the customer must
						choose (no variant set, product has real variants) and
						the dot may add to cart.
					endcomment
					assign show_picker = false
					if show_cart and hv == blank and hp.has_only_default_variant == false
						assign show_picker = true
					endif

					assign media = hv.featured_media | default: hp.featured_media
				-%}

				<button
					type="button"
					class="showcase__dot"
					style="--showcase-x: {{ hx }}%; --showcase-y: {{ hy }}%;"
					popovertarget="{{ popover_id }}"
					data-showcase-hotspot="{{ hp.id }}"
					aria-label="{{ num }}. {{ hp.title | escape }}"
				>
					<span class="showcase__dot-inner" aria-hidden="true">
						<span class="showcase__dot-num">{{ num }}</span>
					</span>
				</button>

				<div
					id="{{ popover_id }}"
					class="showcase__popover"
					popover
					role="dialog"
					data-showcase-popover
					data-showcase-x="{{ hx }}"
					aria-label="{{ hp.title | escape }}"
				>
					<div class="showcase__popover-inner">
						<div class="showcase__popover-head">
							<span class="showcase__popover-pos">{{ 'marketing.showcase.position' | t: current: pos, total: total }}</span>
							<button
								type="button"
								class="showcase__popover-close"
								popovertarget="{{ popover_id }}"
								popovertargetaction="hide"
								aria-label="{{ 'marketing.showcase.close' | t }}"
							>
								{%- render 'html-theme-icons', icon: 'close', size: 16 -%}
							</button>
						</div>

						<div class="showcase__popover-main">
							{%- if media != blank -%}
								<a href="{{ link_url }}" class="showcase__popover-media" tabindex="-1">
									{{- media | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: hp.title, class: 'showcase__popover-image' -}}
								</a>
							{%- endif -%}

							<div class="showcase__popover-body">
								<p class="showcase__popover-title">
									<a href="{{ link_url }}" data-showcase-link>{{ hp.title | escape }}</a>
								</p>
								{%- if hv != blank and hp.has_only_default_variant == false -%}
									<p class="showcase__popover-variant">
										{%- for option in hp.options -%}
											{{ option }}: {{ hv.options[forloop.index0] }}{% unless forloop.last %} · {% endunless %}
										{%- endfor -%}
									</p>
								{%- endif -%}

								<div class="showcase__popover-price">
									{%- render 'html-product-price', product: hp, variant: hv -%}
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						{%- if show_picker -%}
							{%- liquid
								if hp.options.size == 1
									assign picker_label = hp.options.first
								else
									assign picker_label = 'marketing.showcase.variant_label' | t
								endif
							-%}
							<div class="showcase__variants" data-showcase-variants role="group" aria-label="{{ picker_label | escape }}">
								<span class="showcase__variants-label">{{ picker_label | escape }}</span>
								<div class="showcase__variants-list">
									{%- for v in hp.variants -%}
										<button
											type="button"
											class="showcase__variant"
											data-showcase-variant="{{ v.id }}"
											data-url="{{ v.url }}"
											aria-pressed="false"
											{% unless v.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
										>{{ v.title | escape }}</button>
									{%- endfor -%}
								</div>
							</div>
						{%- endif -%}

						<div class="showcase__popover-actions">
							{%- if show_cart -%}
								{%- liquid
									assign order_behavior = 'link'
									if hv != blank or hp.has_only_default_variant or show_picker
										assign order_behavior = 'add'
									endif
								-%}
								{%- render 'html-button-order',
									product: hp,
									variant: hv,
									variant_behavior: order_behavior,
									show_icon: true,
									button_style: 'primary'
								-%}
							{%- endif -%}
							{%- if show_link -%}
								<a href="{{ link_url }}" class="showcase__popover-link" data-showcase-link>
									{{- 'marketing.showcase.view_product' | t -}}
								</a>
							{%- endif -%}
						</div>

						{%- if total > 1 -%}
							<div class="showcase__popover-nav">
								<button type="button" class="showcase__popover-step" data-showcase-step="-1">
									{%- render 'html-theme-icons', icon: 'chevron-left', size: 16 -%}
									<span>{{ 'marketing.showcase.previous' | t }}</span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" class="showcase__popover-step" data-showcase-step="1">
									<span>{{ 'marketing.showcase.next' | t }}</span>
									{%- render 'html-theme-icons', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 16 -%}
								</button>
							</div>
						{%- endif -%}
					</div>
				</div>
			{%- endfor -%}
		</div>
		</div>
	</div>
{%- endif -%}
